    <h2 class="rv in">A spot for every <span class="serif">program.</span></h2>
    <p class="flead rv in">DJ directs and cuts a film for each program, one at a time, built around what that path actually gives a student. Real students play the leads. <b>Same voice across all of them, a different world each time.</b></p>
    <div class="spotgrid">
      {spotFilms.map((p) => (
