      <span class="mono" style="color:#8f8d88">same film, recut</span>
    </div>
    <p class="flead rv in">Every film ships in every ratio the media plan needs. Broadcast and web at 16:9, the feed at 1:1, stories and reels at 9:16. Same story, recut for where it lands.</p>
    <div class="sz-grid rv">
      <figure class="sz sz-16"><video src="/case-studies/cwi/films/size-16x9.mp4" muted loop autoplay playsinline aria-hidden="true"></video><figcaption class="mono">16:9 · broadcast + web</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="sz sz-1"><video src="/case-studies/cwi/films/size-1x1.mp4" muted loop autoplay playsinline aria-hidden="true"></video><figcaption class="mono">1:1 · the feed</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="sz sz-9"><video src="/case-studies/cwi/films/size-9x16.mp4" muted loop autoplay playsinline aria-hidden="true"></video><figcaption class="mono">9:16 · stories + reels</figcaption></figure>
