  <div class="wrap catalog">
    <div class="cat-head rv">
      <span class="k mono">\ The scale</span>
      <h2>A quarterly machine, four years <span class="serif">deep.</span></h2>
      <p>Four to six new films every quarter, each one directed and shot from scratch, then cut down into every aspect ratio and run on TV and across social. Rounds one through six and counting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cat-grid rv">
      {programs.map((p) => (<span class="cat-chip">{p.t}</span>))}
      <span class="cat-chip cat-more">+ more each quarter</span>
